.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3 Find and open teams, see membership at a glance, and switch to Team Health or Insights when you need Goal Confidence status or trends.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  %p.mb-3
    Teams can own goals. Team Health scores those Team-owned goals with the same Goal Confidence rules used for teammates.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li Use Show all Teams / Show Just My Teams to change the list scope.
    %li Open a team for members, huddles, and Team-owned goals.
    %li Use the Object × Lens switchers for List, Health, and Insights.
